title: 基础②·我想要什么
scriptType: practice
---
Tutor: Hello. What do you want?
#objective: Ask for one ticket politely
#chunks: I want some water.,I want a new laptop.,I want one ticket, please.
#user_input
Tutor: One ticket to Central Station?
#objective: Confirm — yes please
#chunks: I want one ticket, please.,I want some water.
#user_input
Tutor: Do you want a morning ticket?
#objective: Say no — you want an afternoon ticket
#chunks: I want one ticket, please.,I want a new laptop.
#user_input
Tutor: The two o'clock ticket?
#objective: Confirm that's right
#chunks: I want one ticket, please.,I want some water.
#user_input
Tutor: Here is your ticket.
#objective: Say thank you
#chunks: I want one ticket, please.,I want a new laptop.
#user_input
Tutor: Thank you.
#objective: Complete the exchange politely
#chunks: I want some water.,I want a new laptop.,I want one ticket, please.
#user_input
Tutor: Well done! You can now ask for what you want in a shop or station.
-> END
